# Gore decals for side-scrolling scenes, 16x16, transparent: pools, sprays,
# handprints, smears, drag trail, ceiling drip, nail scratches, a covered body,
# a bloody locker.
# GORE SET (optional): hidden when the "gore" option is off; see docs/decisions.md D9.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/tiles_gore.png
@preview ../previews/tiles_gore_x4.png 4
@columns 8

